meta {
  name: theme-assets
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Staff-only signed upload URLs for theme image assets (T4,
  `odd/tasks/theme-authoring.md`). Supabase-hosted, same design as
  `contracts/preparation-profile/upload-url` — external client URLs are
  never stored.

  Flow: create the owner first (a preset via `POST /events/themes`, or
  reference an existing event), call
  `POST /theme-assets/upload-url` to get a signed upload URL, upload the
  file directly to `signedUrl`, then `PATCH` the owner's overrides with
  `{ path, url: publicUrl }` in the matching image slot
  (`images.<slot>` — e.g. `images.logo`).

  `ownerType` -> storage folder: `preset` -> `themes/presets/{ownerId}/...`,
  `event` -> `themes/events/{ownerId}/...`.

  Mime whitelist: `image/png`, `image/jpeg`, `image/webp` on every slot;
  `image/svg+xml` only on `logo`, `splashIcon` and `watermark`. Any other
  mime, or svg on another slot, returns 422.

  404 when the owner does not exist or is soft-deleted.

  The `cover` slot's 4:5 aspect ratio is validated client-side, not here.
}
